 nths\\nCategory: STEM\\n\\nIn 2035\, a cop with a deep distrust of artific
 ial intelligence uncovers a conspiracy involving murderous robots on the e
 ve of the biggest household robot deployment in human history. Based on th
 e short stories by Isaac Asimov\, this movie debates the role of robots an
 d AI in our lives. This movie is a part of our Chicago Made Film Fest \, w
 here we'll feature movies made in Chicago all summer long. Come celebrate 
 Chicago with us from the future and the distant past. © Twentieth Century
